    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Jamil,\n\nMy earlier note asked about recurring document work at Shaaban Biedgoly. I wrote a short article on why improving one task doesn't always improve the whole process.\n\nAI can speed up preparation while review and follow-up stay the same. The bigger opportunity is changing how those steps work together. That's shaping our work with PI firms at Possible Minds.\n\nhttps://getpossibleminds.com/t/QmZDz0g9Dg\n\nAs managing partner, would the tools or the team's established routines be harder to change? I'd appreciate even a quick take.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: where AI could compound at Shaaban Biedgoly Injury Lawyers",
